    "custom_collections_community_L76mjK": {
      "type": "custom-collections-community",
      "blocks": {
        "comment_card_MbnHGG": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "Bought for 12 year old son to ride to town, we live out of city limits and he loves it. Fast, easy to ride, long battery life &amp; looks awesome! Would buy again!",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/long-range-ebike-x1s-reviews-1.webp",
            "name": "Tara G.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_3hnjQD": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "I recently got my hands on an electric bike, and I have to say—it’s an absolute game-changer! From the first ride, I was blown away by the smooth acceleration, effortless pedaling, and the freedom it provides. Whether you’re commuting to work, running errands, or simply exploring the outdoors, an e-bike makes every journey more enjoyable.The pedal-assist feature is a lifesaver, especially on hills or long rides. You still get a workout, but without feeling completely drained at the end of the day. The battery life is impressive, lasting for miles before needing a recharge, and the build quality is solid and reliable.One of the best things about an electric bike is how it eliminates the hassle of traffic and parking. It’s a faster, eco-friendly alternative to driving, saving both time and money. Plus, it’s just plain fun—there’s nothing like cruising effortlessly while feeling the wind on your face.If you’re considering an electric bike, I can’t recommend it enough. It’s a smart investment for both convenience and sustainability, making everyday travel a breeze. Once you ride one, you’ll never want to go back!",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/long-range-ebike-x1s-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Felix D.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_rwRGji": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "I just received my macfox X1 dual battery set up. It took 25 days from order until taking possession. Everything checked out except the dual battery set up on the website. It shows two batteries on the bike itself when I receive my bike there’s no place to put the second battery. Meaning you have to carry an extra battery in a backpack if need be before purchasing make sure you confirm this with the manufacturer before buying. Secondly, I also ordered the free tank bag(due to delays in shipping) and fenders for my bike upon taking possession. Those items were not in the box. They are still in route (as stated by the manufacturer) and we are now three days out.Update: 9/25/23 the tank bag and fenders showed up as promised a few days ago. The company is really trying to keep their customers updated and improve product quality. Thus far I have received everything I ordered except the 2nd battery connection attachment. Update 9/29/23 the dual battery connection came today and I was able to install without any problems. Thanks again MacFox!Customer service is extremely responsive! They may take some time to get back to you however they always try to resolve issues. I had mine all taken care of.",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/long-range-ebike-x1s-reviews-2.webp",
            "name": "Leonardo V.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_afpCq9": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "macfox is great for cruising around both on road and off road! Have been cruising all around nyc with it and it has made my commute not only faster but way more fun!The Bike has excellent range and the speed is incomparable to other e-bike options! Would definitely recommend for both city life or for cruising trails!",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/commuter-ebike-x7-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Dylan B.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_in8gTP": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "I recently got my hands on an electric bike, and I have to say—it’s an absolute game-changer! From the first ride, I was blown away by the smooth acceleration, effortless pedaling, and the freedom it provides. Whether you’re commuting to work, running errands, or simply exploring the outdoors, an e-bike makes every journey more enjoyable.The pedal-assist feature is a lifesaver, especially on hills or long rides. You still get a workout, but without feeling completely drained at the end of the day. The battery life is impressive, lasting for miles before needing a recharge, and the build quality is solid and reliable.One of the best things about an electric bike is how it eliminates the hassle of traffic and parking. It’s a faster, eco-friendly alternative to driving, saving both time and money. Plus, it’s just plain fun—there’s nothing like cruising effortlessly while feeling the wind on your face.If you’re considering an electric bike, I can’t recommend it enough. It’s a smart investment for both convenience and sustainability, making everyday travel a breeze. Once you ride one, you’ll never want to go back!",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/commuter-ebike-x1s-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Felix D.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        }
      },
